// Sheet: `duration: Instant` -- unlike every other spell in this batch, this
// one is genuinely a single burst in its own sheet, not a persistent zone.
// The cleanest GroundAoe fit in the batch: Dexterity-save-for-half damage
// plus a knockdown rider both map directly onto GroundAoe's native
// `damage`/`knockback` fields (see hemomancy/bloodboil.ron), with a stronger
// knockback strength than a plain push to read as "swept off their feet".
// `GroundAoe`'s damage strike is hardcoded to `DamageKind::Energy` -- the
// sheet's Bludgeoning damage_type is flavor-only, same pre-existing gap
// every GroundAoe spell in this pipeline ships with. GroundAoe has no line-
// shaped strike; the sheet's 9 m line/wave footprint is approximated as a
// circular burst of half that radius (4.5 m), the same shape-approximation
// precedent every other zone in this pipeline already uses for its own
// non-sphere sheet footprint.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 100.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    delay: 0.45,
    recover_duration: 0.45,
    max_range: 37.0,
    radius: 4.5,
    min_falloff: 0.35,
    damage: 40.0,
    poise: 15.0,
    knockback: (strength: 14.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: Some(Blue),
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
